# Big fields from above (reports/engine/2026-11-18-grass-volume, «Большие поля»): the far look of the grass where
# 48-150 m of a field fills the frame, a free camera 14 m over the ground at a field's edge looking 90 m across it.
# Frames and counts, no time: run once per ring on Ryzen at 2560x1440 with OPENGOTHIC_GRASS_WASTE=1 and the set,
# with and without OPENGOTHIC_GRASS_RING=<from>,<to>. Each view: `grass stats`, a shot as it is, the ground painted
# by the bands between the blades (`grass parts 512`) and without them (640).
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode walk
watch player
# view 1: Sekob's field from 14 m over its edge
goto NW_FARM3_PATH_04
cam at 44181 4060 -17628 47984 2814 -25785
clear 3000
wait 15000
grass wait
wait 2000
grass stats
shot view-1
wait 300
grass parts 512
wait 1000
shot view-1-bands
wait 300
grass parts 640
wait 1000
shot view-1-bands-all
wait 300
grass parts 0
# view 2: Onar's fields from the slope above them
goto NW_BIGFARM_FARM4_PATH_07
cam at 64807 5560 -10675 55841 1768 -11459
wait 15000
grass wait
wait 2000
grass stats
shot view-2
wait 300
grass parts 512
wait 1000
shot view-2-bands
wait 300
grass parts 640
wait 1000
shot view-2-bands-all
wait 300
grass parts 0
# view 3: Lobart's pasture from 14 m over the path
goto NW_FARM1_PATH_CITY_SHEEP_02
cam at 9584 2880 -20701 11914 1358 -12007
wait 15000
grass wait
wait 2000
grass stats
shot view-3
wait 300
grass parts 512
wait 1000
shot view-3-bands
wait 300
grass parts 640
wait 1000
shot view-3-bands-all
wait 300
grass parts 0
